<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-pezzulo-bioelectric-target-morphology-memory> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Pezzulo & Levin (2015) / Friston et al. (2015) bioelectric target morphology memory and Variational Free Energy homeostasis (Ambystoma mexicanum (axolotl salamander) regenerating forelimb)",
        "Pezzulo & Levin (2015) / Friston et al. (2015) bioelectric target morphology memory and Variational Free Energy homeostasis faithfully reproduces Ambystoma mexicanum (axolotl salamander) regenerating forelimb morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/pezzulo-bioelectric-target-morphology-memory-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/pezzulo-bioelectric-target-morphology-memory-2>,
